# A decoder tools/decodetree --a64 refuses (tests/CMakeLists.txt, a64_decode_unordered): x ^ 2 is not rising, so its
# field's values are tried one by one for the argument's type, and 21 bits are more than it tries.
%wide   0:21 !function=xor_2
&w      wide
WIDE    1000 0000 000 .....................  &w wide=%wide
